<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><title>白底v1 vs v2 · 31张</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#1a1a2e;--card:#16213e;--border:#2a2a4a;--text:#e0e0e0}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:-apple-system,"PingFang SC",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}
header{background:var(--card);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 20px}
.pair{display:flex;margin:10px 20px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
.ib{flex:1;min-width:200px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#0a0a1a;padding:8px;position:relative;min-height:180px}
.ib img{max-width:100%;max-height:250px;object-fit:contain}
.lbl{position:absolute;top:5px;left:5px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.7);color:#fff;font-size:8px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:2px}
.qc{width:180px;min-width:180px;padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:4px}
.qc .fn{font-size:10px;font-weight:600}
.qc .meta{display:flex;gap:4px;font-size:9px;align-items:center}
.qc .badge{padding:1px 6px;border-radius:8px;font-size:8px;color:#fff;font-weight:600}
</style></head><body>
